    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mbango kūlwa wigwi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mutalizūgima kwibeegeja shikolo, nūūlū shiikolile shose shose, sha suso ya kīnhū, nūūlū ya munhū. Yaya nūūlū kwīmīlīja ng'hīngī ya mawe, nūūlū kūtūūla hose hose ū mu sī ying'we iwe lya kwiloleelwa na banhū. Yaya kwinama kū shikolo shilī gīko; ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shilagīlo shane sha Sabato shidimagi n'ikūjo; hama nī lipandī lyane ī lyeela mulītūūlīle logohano. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ng'ūshimīzīla ū mu malange gane, nī shilagīlo shane ng'ūshilondeela na welwa ng'holò, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakūmutūmīla ī mbula mu makanza gayo, nī sī īkūzwisha īsho shiigeli kūzwa; ī mitī ya mu matogolo nayo īkūtwaja a matwajo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A makanza ging'we ga kūtūla shilīwa gakwiyingīlīīla na makanza ga kūhūlūla mizabibu; a makanza ga kūhūlūla mizabibu nago gakwiyingīlīīla na makanza ga kūlīma. Nīyo būlī shilīwa īsho mutogilwe mukūpandīka, mukūlya na mukwikala mhola ū mu sī ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmutūūlīla mhola ū mu sī ying'we, mukūlaala na atigela wa kūng'ogohya. Nakūng'wīngīja a mashiinū a makenaagūji ū mu sī ying'we, nūūlū būlūgū būtīkoya ī sī ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banishi bing'we mukūbapyena mubapeeje, na kūbabūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū banhū batanò dūhū ū mu bing'we bakūpeeja banishi igana; a banhū igana ū mu bing'we bakūpeeja shihūmbī ikūmi. Nīyo mukūbabūlaga no a banishi bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūng'wītīla yawiza, na nakūng'wīta mubize bibyaji; nū wingī wing'we nakūbongeja no no no. Nakūlīshikīlīja ī lilagane lyane ū kū bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilīwa shing'we shikūbiza sha kwisanga sanga; nose īkūyūng'wigeleelwa kūshiponya ī sha kale mupandīke ha kūtūūla ī shipya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūbeeja wikalo wa kwikala hamò ning'we; nīyo ū kūlī nene mutalasūūka na hado yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūshimīza hamò ning'we, na nakūbiza Mulungu wing'we, na a bing'we mukūbiza banhū bane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we ūyo wang'wenha kūfuma mu sī ya Misili, gīkī ng'oye kūbiza basese kū bana Misili. Nakalībīnzagūla ī lijoki ling'we muyūshimīza ng'wiyagaalūlaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango kūlwa būshitiigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alīyo ūlū ng'ūlema ū kūnidegeleka, nū kwīta pyī ī yose īyo nalīmulagīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūlū ng'ūgalema a malange gane, nī shilagīlo shane ng'ūshidalaha, ng'ūlemeelwa ū kwīshikīlīja pyī īyo nalīmulagīla, nī lilagane lyane ng'ūlīkenaagūla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yīīyī īyo nakūng'wītīla: Nakūng'wenhela lyogohya lya kūng'wisanganīja, na mabūsaatu gatī ga kūpīla, na saata ja kūmukenaagūja miso na kūgogolohya mibīlī. Ī mbīyū mukūhamba ū mu migūnda ying'we alīyo mukūnogela dalali dūhū, nguno ī shilīwa īsho shilapye shikūlyiwa na banhū bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūgalūka kūbiza ng'wilwisha wing'we, kūshisha a banishi bing'we bamupyeene kībi kībi; abo bamukolilwe bakūmusuga, na mukūyūpeela sagala nūūlū atīho wa kūmupeeja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū nūng'winha nsango gīko alīyo ng'wikala mutaalī mulemile ū kūnidegeleka, ū nsango ūyo nakūng'winha kūlwa shibi shing'we nakūgongeja ū būdito ng'hangala mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūng'wīngīja īsho mushisendamīlile, īsho shikang'winhaga nguzu ja kwikumīlīja, nakūgapyagūla a malunde a higūlū īlo līlī higūlya ya sī ying'we, lyeele pe gītī ibbaadi; nī sī ying'we nūyīkalanga yūūkalamuka gītī itale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī milīmo mukwīta ya kūnogela madūhū, nguno mutūpandīka shose shose ū mu migūnda ying'we; nī mitī ya mu matogolo ītūtwaja a matwajo gayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ng'wikala mutaalī bagang'hanazu, mulemile ū kūnidegeleka, a makoye ga būlūhi wing'we nakūgongeja ng'hangala mpungatī, gadidohe gīt'ūmo shilī ī shibi shing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmutūmīla mashiinū makenaagūji gayūbabūlaga a baana bing'we, na kūmukenaagūja ī mitugo jing'we; gakūmugeehya no, ī nzīla jing'we ī ng'humūūku jigayiwe a banhū ba kūjibītīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alīyo ūlū nūng'wītīla pyī ī yose īyī hūna ng'wikala mulemile dūhū ū kūgalūka, ng'ūbiza mutaalī munigomelile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho lūūlū nene ng'wenekīlī nakwandya kwilwisha ning'we; ū būluhi ūbo nalang'winhe kūlwa shibi shing'we nakūbongeja būdidohe ng'hangala mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwenha būlūgū ū mu sī ying'we kūlwa kūmumalīla shiilī, nguno ya kūlīkenaagūla ī lilagane. Ūlū ng'wilugalīla mu mizengo ying'we gīkī ng'wipīje, nakūmutūmīla mo mahūūya; hama nakūmutūūla mu makono ga banishi bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmutūmīla nzala ng'halī, ī shilīwa shibize sha kwineneela no; bakīma ikūmi bakūyūsangīla kūzuga shilīwa mu liiko līmò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Liiko līmò:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī liiko īlo līlīhayiwa, ī lya būgubbanīje, (oveni); ū mu shikū ja shilīwa shingī, būlī nkīma wabizaga na liiko lyakwe. Baalī batasangīlaga.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Īsho balashizuge shikūmeganyiwa, būlī ng'wene apandīke kapuli kado ka mu nkono atwale kū ng'wakwe, mukūlya a hene, alīyo mutigūta yaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī mihayo ūlū yūshika gīko alīyo ng'ūbiza mutaalī munigomelile dūhū, mulemile ū kūnidegeleka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho nakwilwisha ning'we mu būpelanu būtaale no. Nene ng'wenekīlī nakūgongeja hangī ng'hangala mpungatī ū nsango gwa kūng'winha kūlwa shibi shing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A baana bing'we, bagosha na bakīma, mukwandya kūyūūbalya nyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mapandī ging'we ga kūlamīja ayo galī higūlya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mapandī ga higūlya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo bazengaga mapandī ga kūlamīja, higūlya ya ngūlū, nūūlū higūlya ya migūngūli, nūūlū ha mashigūlū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nakūgasambaagūla, nī myalīlo ying'we ya kūzuukīja būbbani nīīkambagūla; ī mibimba ying'we nakwīlūndīka ha mashiikolile ging'we ga kūlamiwa, ayo gatī na būpanga; nīyo nakūmusūūcha no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ying'we nakūyīta kūbiza ya mapagale, na a mapandī ging'we a meela gabize buyīīkī; nū ng'waso gwa shakwinha shing'we natūgūyegela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī ying'we nakwībipya no, na a banishi bing'we abo balayīdime bakūjinjimala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmusalang'hanīja kū mahanga, alīyo nū kwene nakūmukūūbīja na līlūshū lyane mu nkono. Ī sī ying'we īkūbiza buyīīkī, nī mizengo ying'we īkūbiza ya mapagale gike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a henaho ī sī īkūlīlūmba ī likanza lya kwifuula; nguno ū mu shikū ījo mukūbiza mu sī ya banishi bing'we, ī sī īkwikala buyīīkī yifuule, ījilūmbe ī sabato jayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī īkwifuula ū ng'wikanza lyose īlo īkūbiza buyīīkī; ū mu shikū jenījo īkūbiza ng'wikanza lya kwifuula, īlo ītalīpandīkile mu sabato jayo ū mu shikū ja kwikala kwing'we mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abo balasaage bapanga ū mu bing'we, nakūbatūūlīla ng'holò ya kwikala bakwibakīlaga ū mu sī ya banishi babo; nūūlū bigwa kapalala kasaganya nguno ya lūyaga, bakwibakīla bandye kūpeela gītī balīmpeela mūlagi; bakūja bakūgwaaga sagala gītī balīpeejiwa na munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwipamagūla no gītī balīmpeela munhū abūūkije lūshū; nūūlū aho atīho ūyo alībapeeja. Na lūūlū mutūdūla ū kūbīīmīla a banishi bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūchīla kū mahanga, mumilwe sī ya banishi bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo balikale bapanga ū mu bing'we bakūshila poole poole; bakūshilīla mu sī ja banishi babo kūlwa nguno ya shibi shabo. Bakūshila poole poole gīko kūlwa nguno ya shibi shabo na sha basaabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagane kwītwa būpya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alīyo ūlū būshitambūūla ī shibi shabo, nī shibi sha basaabo; būyīhabūla hape ī mihayo īyo baanikenya, nū būlambu wabo wa kūshilema ī shilagilo shane, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū būgalūka booya ū kūyīta ī mihayo īyo īkanenheleja nabize ng'wanishi wabo, nose nūūbaponya kūle mu sī ya banishi babo, ī ng'holò jabo ī ngang'hanazu ūlū jūbiza na kwidoohya, nī mheela ya shibi shabo būbiza bayanukūla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho lūūlū hū nakūlizūkwa ī lilagane lyane īlo naalagana na Yakobo na Isaka, na Abulahamu; hū nakūyizūkwa nī sī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī sī yenīyo shiigelile bayīngīle, ījilūmbe ī sabato jayo ū ng'wikanza lya kūbiza buyīīkī, a boi batīīmo. Ū nsango gwenūyo gūkūbagwīīla kūlwa nguno ya shibi shabo na kūlwa kūshilema ī shilagīlo shane na kūgadalaha a malange gane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene nūūlū ū mu yose yenīyī, ūlū balī ū mu sī ya banishi babo, natūūbaponya jigi, nūūlū kūbisuusumūla gete gīkī nabakenaagūle ilalī. Natīīko ū kūlīkenaagūla ī lilagane lyane ū kūbo. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī aboi balī banhū bane, nakūlizūkwa ī lilagane lyane īlo nakabeeja na bakūlūgenji babo, abo nakabīnja mu sī ya Misili, kū būtongi wa mahanga; aho nakahaya gīkī nakūbiza Mulungu wabo. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A genaya hū a malange na shilagīlo, na katongeelele ako SEEBA akabeeja ha gatī yakwe na Baisilaeli kū lūgūlū lwa Sinai mu būtūmami bo ng'wa Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
